  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1179258880
    m_Localized: Echo of Absorption
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1288310784
    m_Localized: When the player successfully performs an Absorption, 1 extra action
      is guaranteed once per turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17556453552951296
    m_Localized: Initial Acceleration Module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17556453620060160
    m_Localized: An untransformed Devorya [Pawn] can move forward two squares on
      its first move in battle. Both squares must be empty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17556453812998144
    m_Localized: Residual Thrust Controller
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17556453812998145
    m_Localized: Successfully absorbing an enemy piece immediately grants one extra
      move. This extra move cannot capture an enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17556453989158912
    m_Localized: Absorption Overcharger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17556453989158913
    m_Localized: Successfully absorbing an enemy piece increases maximum energy by
      1 during your next turn. The bonus expires when that turn ends and does not
      stack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
